              "text": "The oak? (la quercia.) The pine? (il pino.) The fir? (l'abete.) To prune? (potare.) The bark? (la corteccia.) The summit? (la vetta.) The slope? (il pendio.) The ravine? (il burrone.) The cave? (la caverna.) To climb? (arrampicarsi.) The rock? (lo scoglio.) To get a tan? (abbronzarsi.) The seashell? (la conchiglia.) The tide? (la marea.) To dive? (tuffarsi.) The wild boar? (il cinghiale.) The deer? (il cervo.) The hare? (la lepre.) The falcon? (il falco.) To graze? (brucare.) The lizard? (la lucertola.) The viper? (la vipera.) The toad? (il rospo.) The snail? (la lumaca.) To slither? (strisciare.) The sultry heat? (l'afa.) Sultry? (afoso.) To get sunburnt? (scottarsi.) The drought? (la siccità.) The breeze? (la brezza.) The flash of lightning? (il lampo.) To thunder? (tuonare.) To flash? (lampeggiare.) The hail? (la grandine.) To hail? (grandinare.) The frost? (il gelo.) To freeze? (gelare.) The white frost? (la brina.) The dew? (la rugiada.) To deep-freeze? (congelare.)"
